(text "REV V: 288V 32GB / FICTIONAL PEX90064 / THUNDERBOLT 3 HOST\nPEX90064 has an invented 1024-ball map. 12 E1.S x4 plus CPU x4; 12 spare lanes. Nominal SSD side/bottom gap 7.25mm. TB3 host: Alpine Ridge DP + TPS65982. 12V SSD and 3.3V/5V auxiliary power drawn. CPU VR and fictional switch supplies pending; thermal / current / SI unqualified.\nCPU pin directions and power inputs are modeled. ERC power-driver errors expose unfinished supply domains.\nSee README.md and VALIDATION.json before manufacturing." (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "ab012126-acd1-4375-b384-c6d66d949ed4"))
